# Reconstructed zbus source packages and GNU consumer gate

The local zbus backport now has three reproducible source archives, a pinned
whole-preimage recipe and a separate GNU consumer built from their reconstructed
members. That consumer passes **67/67 tests**, check and strict Clippy on both
**Rust 1.94 and MSRV 1.88**. Thirteen inert archive/export controls pass. This is
source-package preparation, not publication, root adoption, full dependency-policy
acceptance, production enrollment or release/server admission.

