including tests, equal the previous selected candidate. The independent probe
keeps all 67 identities; there is no copied package test overlay inside a
canonical crate and no deletion/renaming of earlier cases.

Actual Cargo executable path/source/SHA and complete test listings are bound for
each compiler. Both images pass 67/67 with zero failures/filtered cases, plus
