feature/target/upstream-test coverage. Caller/read/peer-mismatch transcripts and
the original seeded ReplyState transcript equal the predecessor. The latter
keeps 512 sequences, 16,384 random steps and 17,150 checks per compiler. These are
coverage counts, not speed or allocation claims.

The pinned existing CI owner retains the original local 1200-second outer and
